{"seq":2,"slug":"electronic-circuits","title":"高一通用技术 — 电子电路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/electronic-circuits","wordCount":2121,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一通用技术-电子电路\">高一通用技术 — 电子电路</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>按下手电筒开关，灯泡亮了——这个动作背后是一条完整的电路在工作。电子电路是现代技术的神经系统，从简单的手电筒到复杂的智能手机，所有电子设备都建立在电路的基础之上。高一通用技术中学习电子电路，重点在于理解基本元件的功能和简单电路的搭建，为后续的智能技术应用打下基础。</p>\n<p>电路的四个基本组成部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>常见元件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电源</td>\n<td>提供电能</td>\n<td>干电池、锂电池、USB 供电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载</td>\n<td>消耗电能做功</td>\n<td>灯泡、电机、蜂鸣器、LED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导线</td>\n<td>连接各元件形成回路</td>\n<td>铜导线、电路板走线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制元件</td>\n<td>控制电路通断或调节</td>\n<td>开关、电位器、传感器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电路工作的基本条件：必须形成从电源正极出发、经过负载、回到电源负极的闭合回路。回路中任何一处断开，电流就无法流通——这就是开关控制电路的原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-基本电学量\">一、基本电学量</h3><p><strong>电压（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>——推动电流流动的&quot;力&quot;</p>\n<p>电压是电路中两点之间的电位差，单位是伏特（V）。可以将电压类比为水管中的水压：水压越高，水流越猛；电压越高，推动电流的能力越强。</p>\n<p>常见电压参考值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一节干电池：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>USB 供电：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>家用交流电：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（危险，不可直接触碰）</li>\n<li>人体安全电压：≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>电流（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>——电荷的定向流动</p>\n<p>电流是单位时间内通过导体横截面的电荷量，单位是安培（A）。电流类比为水管中的水流量。</p>\n<p><strong>电阻（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>——阻碍电流的&quot;摩擦力&quot;</p>\n<p>电阻反映导体对电流的阻碍程度，单位是欧姆（Ω）。不同材料的电阻率不同：铜的电阻率很低（良导体），橡胶的电阻率极高（绝缘体）。</p>\n<p><strong>欧姆定律</strong>——三者的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\frac{U}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即电压越高、电阻越小，电流越大。这是分析所有电路的基础公式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-常用电子元件\">二、常用电子元件</h3><p><strong>电阻器</strong>：限制电流大小，分压。色环电阻通过色环组合表示阻值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色环颜色</th>\n<th>对应数字</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黑</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>棕</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>橙</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紫</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四环电阻读法：前两环为有效数字，第三环为倍率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），第四环为误差。例如红紫橙金 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27 \\times 10^3 = 27k\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">±5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>电容器</strong>：储存电荷，滤波。可以类比为水管系统中的蓄水池。充电时储存能量，放电时释放能量。电容量单位为法拉（F），实际中常用微法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>）和皮法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">pF</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>二极管</strong>：只允许电流单向流通。类似于水管中的单向阀。正向导通、反向截止。发光二极管（LED）在导通时发光，是节能照明的核心元件。</p>\n<p><strong>三极管</strong>：可以用小电流控制大电流，起到放大或开关作用。它是所有芯片和计算机的基础元件——一个现代处理器中集成了数十亿个微型三极管。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-基本电路连接方式\">三、基本电路连接方式</h3><p><strong>串联电路</strong>：元件首尾相连，电流只有一条通路。</p>\n<p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各处电流相等：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = I_1 = I_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>总电压等于各元件电压之和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = U_1 + U_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>总电阻等于各电阻之和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = R_1 + R_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>一个元件断开，整个电路断路</li>\n</ul>\n<p>应用：老式串联装饰灯（一个灯泡坏了全串都灭）、电池串联提升电压。</p>\n<p><strong>并联电路</strong>：元件两端分别连在一起，电流有多条通路。</p>\n<p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各支路电压相等：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = U_1 = U_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>总电流等于各支路电流之和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = I_1 + I_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>总电阻的倒数等于各电阻倒数之和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{R} = \\frac{1}{R_1} + \\frac{1}{R_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2902em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2902em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>一条支路断开，其他支路不受影响</li>\n</ul>\n<p>应用：家庭用电（各电器并联在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 电源上）、并联电池增大容量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-传感器电路基础\">四、传感器电路基础</h3><p>传感器将物理量（光、温度、声音、压力）转化为电信号，是电子电路与物理世界的桥梁。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传感器类型</th>\n<th>检测对象</th>\n<th>工作原理</th>\n<th>常见应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光敏电阻</td>\n<td>光照强度</td>\n<td>光照越强电阻越小</td>\n<td>自动路灯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热敏电阻</td>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>温度变化引起电阻变化</td>\n<td>温度报警器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声音传感器</td>\n<td>声音强度</td>\n<td>声波振动产生电信号</td>\n<td>声控开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红外传感器</td>\n<td>人体红外辐射</td>\n<td>检测人体热辐射</td>\n<td>自动门</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>光控灯电路原理</strong>：</p>\n<p>光敏电阻与固定电阻串联分压。白天光照强时光敏电阻小，分压低，三极管截止，灯灭；夜晚光照弱时光敏电阻大，分压高，三极管导通，灯亮。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-电路设计与安全\">五、电路设计与安全</h3><p><strong>电路设计的基本步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>明确功能需求（要实现什么？）</li>\n<li>选择合适的元件</li>\n<li>画出电路原理图</li>\n<li>在面包板上搭建试验</li>\n<li>测试调试</li>\n<li>制作成品（焊接到万用板或 PCB）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>电路安全注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>绝对不要直接接触 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 交流电路</li>\n<li>电容器可能储存电荷，拆卸前先放电</li>\n<li>LED 必须串联限流电阻，否则会烧毁</li>\n<li>电源正负极不能直接短接（会产生大电流引发危险）</li>\n<li>焊接时注意烫伤防护，保持通风</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>万用表的基本使用</strong>：</p>\n<p>万用表是电路调试的基本工具，可以测量电压（V 挡）、电流（A 挡）和电阻（Ω 挡）。使用前先选择正确的量程，测电压时并联在被测元件两端，测电流时串联在被测支路中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 电池连接一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 电阻和一个红色 LED（正向压降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>）。计算通过 LED 的电流，判断是否在安全范围内（LED 额定电流通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20mA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>）。如果电流过大，应该更换多大的电阻？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>两个灯泡分别标有&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3V, 0.3A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;和&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3V, 0.5A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;，它们的电阻各是多少？如果将它们串联接在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 电源上，每个灯泡两端的电压是多少？哪个更亮？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个简单的声控灯电路方案：有声音时灯亮，无声音时灯灭。画出电路框图，标注传感器、控制模块和执行器。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>家庭中厨房的电灯和客厅的电灯是串联还是并联？为什么家用电器采用并联而非串联？如果全部串联会出现什么问题？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>读出以下色环电阻的阻值：(a) 棕-黑-红-金；(b) 黄-紫-橙-银；(c) 橙-橙-棕-金。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>电子技术的发展是人类科技史上最快的领域之一。1947 年贝尔实验室发明了第一个晶体管（三极管），体积如手指大小。如今一个指甲盖大小的芯片上可以集成超过 100 亿个晶体管。摩尔定律预言集成电路的晶体管数量每 18-24 个月翻一番，这一规律从 1965 年至今大体成立。</p>\n<p>值得了解的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Arduino 开发板</strong>：是学习电子电路和编程的绝佳工具，用简单的代码就能控制 LED、电机、传感器等元件</li>\n<li><strong>PCB 设计</strong>：专业电路不是在面包板上搭建的，而是用软件设计印刷电路板（PCB），然后工厂批量生产</li>\n<li><strong>集成电路的奇迹</strong>：你口袋里的手机处理器包含的晶体管数量超过全世界所有道路上的沙粒数量——这是电子技术从简单电路发展到极致的成果</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>电子电路由电源、负载、导线和控制元件组成，必须形成闭合回路才能工作。欧姆定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = U/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是分析电路的基础工具。串联电路电流处处相等，并联电路电压处处相等。传感器将物理信号转化为电信号，是电路感知外界的窗口。电路操作必须注重安全，尤其要避免接触高压电路。下一节将学习智能技术，了解电子电路与软件结合后能产生多么强大的功能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一通用技术 — 电子电路","id":"高一通用技术-电子电路"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、基本电学量","id":"一-基本电学量"},{"level":3,"text":"二、常用电子元件","id":"二-常用电子元件"},{"level":3,"text":"三、基本电路连接方式","id":"三-基本电路连接方式"},{"level":3,"text":"四、传感器电路基础","id":"四-传感器电路基础"},{"level":3,"text":"五、电路设计与安全","id":"五-电路设计与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 机械结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/mechanical-structure"},"next":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 智能技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/smart-tech"}}